  "decision": "Retain v600 as the current source-true technical verification frame. It preserves the v595 bounded deterministic low-discrepancy spray upgrade and restores the source-equivalent procedural boulder path after rejecting the v599 generated world-aligned granodiorite branch for a near-black, faceted renderer regression. Keep the generated texture and provenance only as unpromoted source art; the current runtime boulder material has no reference to it. Reject v600 for photoreal, marketing, store, press, and human approval because the broad water remains planar, aerosol remains visibly procedural, and the faces, hands, hair/helmet integration, PFD/clothing, raft, boulder, lighting, shoreline, and terrain remain visibly synthetic or unfinished."
